# The player whose turn it is discards down to their maximum hand size in the cleanup step a turn ended by Time Stop
# skips to (CR 724.1d, 514.1). Bot1 plays nothing, so it holds eight cards after its turn-3 draw; Bot2 ends that turn in
# the draw step, and Bot1 discards one card of its choice at cleanup.

[Bot1 Deck]
Island x7
Lightning Bolt
Island x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Island
Mox Sapphire
Mox Jet
Mox Pearl
Mox Ruby
Sol Ring
Time Stop
Island x10

